# Wave W17-L (Meadowbrook Woods): silk strand — a fallen silk-strung log section on the soft ground, pale silk threads drawn across the bark where the SILKWURM work it (design: silk lines in the woods — the strung lines between trunks are creature-layer dressing; the fallen section is what the ground can honestly carry), on shade turf (fully opaque, ground baked in).
